ctual data in the specified X and Y columns isn&#39;t being used and instead it&#39;s treating &quot;X&quot; and &quot;Y&quot; as factors hence the single data point. How can I fix this, Is there a problem with how my dataframe is formatted?<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
