   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for the reply. I was using quotes because my column headings aren&#39;t actually X and Y (I probably should have given the actual names) they are strings with special characters (+ and - symbols) in them) but even with aes_string and quoting the values they don&#39;t work (object not found). Once I changed the names to simpler text they work as expected so I will change the names for now.<br></div>"
    ]
